{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在人物动机解释和前后因果衔接上明显不如Y，有些地方需要观众自己补足心理过程。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的重点词突出，话与感受交替，且部分感受跟随音乐进程出现，观众可以先抓住人物当下的核心心事，再逐渐接收更细的情绪和音乐变化，比较适合边听边扫。Y的人物动机和心理转折解释得更完整，前后因果也更连贯，但长句较多，快速浏览时不容易立即抓住重点。综合而言我选X，因为它在即时阅读、段落重点和音乐情绪细节上的优势更符合这个观看场景，不过Y讲清楚人物为什么这样想、整段故事如何发展，确实更胜一筹。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "67339dc6-3492-4de6-bf07-ed62241501e7", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T002550312115Z", "elapsed_seconds": 76.156, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T00:27:06.487397+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a253d58ec67b70fca9b0792d3ee54d7b171263d2fbc13062ebe55b44e4aa4381", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt